My analysis regarding this defect: the `while lo < hi` loop terminates the moment the range narrows down to a **single** element, so that lone candidate is never compared against the target. As a result, a single-element list, the last element of `[2, 4]`, or any target whose search range collapses into `lo == hi` will all be reported as "not found."


